{"images":[],"manifest":{"budgetTokens":15000,"countMethod":"proxy","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","packSha":"f47b583ad1f561d4d576bc66cf42c403d6d5d422786b4da91efb6fd59ca64c13","packTokens":2052,"recipeVersion":"1","redactions":0,"sections":[{"id":"tpl","tokens":67,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"},{"id":"spans","tokens":2,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"answers","tokens":743,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"sentences","tokens":1169,"trimmed":false,"trust":"derived"},{"id":"task","tokens":8,"trimmed":false,"trust":"trusted"}],"stage":"round-trip"},"pointers":[],"system":"Map each restated sentence to the original intent spans (I-n) and answers (Q-n) it comes from. A sentence that matches none gets empty lists. Every sentence n must appear once.","tools":[],"user":"<artifact id=\"spans\" kind=\"intent\" sha=\"\">\n[]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"answers\" kind=\"answers\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-1\",\n  \"question\": \"What is the deliverable for this request: the itemised estimate and technology proposal (sections 74–75), or building the first-release portal described in section 76?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Produce the itemised estimate and technology proposal only\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-2\",\n  \"question\": \"Does 'Payments' mean the portal takes money online, or only records an invoice's payment status?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Track payment status only (unpaid/paid/overdue), updated manually by staff\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-3\",\n  \"question\": \"The backend checklist includes 'Order amendments', but the scope summary does not. Are order amendments part of the first release, and who can make them?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Staff can amend orders before dispatch\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-4\",\n  \"question\": \"Which roles exist, and are there roles within a customer company, such as a company admin or a buyer who needs approval?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Three roles only: customer user, staff, admin\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-5\",\n  \"question\": \"Can staff manage customer/company records and users, or is that admin-only?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Staff manage customers/companies; only admins manage users, products and price lists\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-6\",\n  \"question\": \"Who can cancel an order, and up to which point?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Customers and staff can cancel before dispatch\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-7\",\n  \"question\": \"Now that staff can amend orders before dispatch: when is the invoice created automatically, and what happens to it if an order is amended?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Invoice is created on dispatch, so amendments before dispatch never touch an invoice\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"Q-8\",\n  \"question\": \"How does the ERP stock CSV reach the portal, and how often?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Assume a daily scheduled pickup, stated as an assumption\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"sentences\" kind=\"restated\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"n\": 1,\n  \"text\": \"The estimate must list all 81 section-74 checklist items as individual line items under their section headings (Product/UX 8, Frontend 20, Backend 20, Integrations 5, QA 12, DevOps 10, Documentation 6), not estimated by screen count.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 2,\n  \"text\": \"Each line item must show a low and high effort value in person-days, with low less than or equal to high.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 3,\n  \"text\": \"Each section must show a subtotal, and the subtotals must sum to a grand total, all consistent with the line item values.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 4,\n  \"text\": \"Each of the 33 first-release scope items from section 76 must be mapped to at least one line item.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 5,\n  \"text\": \"The Payments line items must be scoped to staff manually setting invoice status to unpaid, paid, or overdue, with no online payment collection.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 6,\n  \"text\": \"The Order amendments line item must be scoped to staff amending orders before dispatch.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 7,\n  \"text\": \"Authorization, user management, customer management, permission testing, and customer data-isolation testing line items must be based on exactly three roles: customer user, staff, and admin.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 8,\n  \"text\": \"Staff manage customers and companies; only admins manage users, products, and price lists.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 9,\n  \"text\": \"A customer user can see only their own company's orders, invoices, and prices.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 10,\n  \"text\": \"Order cancellation and order state transition line items must allow customer users and staff to cancel an order only until it is dispatched.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 11,\n  \"text\": \"Invoice line items must reflect that an invoice is created automatically when an order is dispatched and that pre-dispatch amendments never change an invoice.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 12,\n  \"text\": \"The ERP CSV import and Import testing line items must be scoped to a daily scheduled pickup of a stock-quantity-only file.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 13,\n  \"text\": \"A file with bad rows or unknown SKUs must be rejected as a whole, keeping previous stock and logging or alerting an error.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 14,\n  \"text\": \"The estimate must include a numbered assumptions list stating every item the estimate depends on that the client has not confirmed.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 15,\n  \"text\": \"The technology proposal must name one recommended choice with a reason for each of the 10 section-75 areas: frontend framework, backend framework, database, authentication approach, file storage, email integration, PDF generation approach, hosting/cloud platform, CI/CD, and monitoring/logging.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 16,\n  \"text\": \"The authentication approach recommendation must support email-and-password sign-in with an email reset link.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 17,\n  \"text\": \"The technology proposal must explain how the proposed stack supports up to 1,000 users and 100,000 records in the first year.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 18,\n  \"text\": \"The technology proposal must explain how order and invoice records are kept for at least 7 years without deletion.\"\n },\n {\n  \"n\": 19,\n  \"text\": \"The technology proposal must recommend hosting in one cloud region within the client's own cloud account.\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\nMap the sentences."}